    docs(CF-176): scope the grep transcript to the shipped prose it measured
    
    The judge run CF-176-DOC3 flagged the §3 transcript's `NO_MATCHES_ANY_DOC` line as possibly stale
    because this audit file itself contains the removed phrase. It reproduces exactly — the documented
    glob (`docs/*.md README.md specs/*.md`) does not descend into `docs/audits/` — but the record now
    says so explicitly, names the recursive count (6, all quotations), and states why the audit keeps
    the phrase. No shipped prose and no acceptance target changes in this commit.
