 docs/audits/code-factory-docs-2026-11-04-CF-176.md | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/audits/code-factory-docs-2026-11-04-CF-176.md b/docs/audits/code-factory-docs-2026-11-04-CF-176.md
index 16f3779..4b84442 100644
